The '''Viking Longhouse''' is a sub-location of [[The Park]].

{{ZoneText|Help the &bMelancholic Viking&f.}}

== Features ==
The '''Viking Longhouse''' features one main attraction.

=== Melancholic Viking ===
{{Main|Melancholic Viking}}
The {{NPCSprite|Melancholic Viking}} is an [[NPC]] located on the wooden throne at the end of the '''Viking Longhouse'''. They ask the player to remind them of the sea, requiring a fish to be cooked in the furnace, the fire to be put out and multiple splashes from the {{Item|Fish Hat}}. After doing so, lightning will strike down from the sky and the NPC, now named {{NPCSprite|Joyful Viking}}, will open their shop to the entire lobby for a few minutes.

